<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0195_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">First, we hold your homies while you\nrent ours. Like a car rental. For\fviolence.\rChoose carefully. No refunds.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0195_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Please wait a moment.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0195_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Please go in.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0195_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Well done!\nYour rentals will be healed now.\fDon’t scratch ’em.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0195_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Next up, battle no. {STRVAR_1 53, 0, 0}!\nAre you ready?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0195_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Would you like to trade Pokémon before\nyour battle?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0195_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Would you like to save the last battle\nas your Battle Video?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0195_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}’s battle has been saved\nas a Battle Video.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0195_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">There was an error.\nThe Battle Video couldn’t be saved.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0195_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Delete your existin’ Battle Video and\nsave the last battle?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0195_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Saving...\nDon’t turn off the power.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0195_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Would you like to save and take a break\nfrom playin’?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0195_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Would you like to retire from this\nBattle Factory challenge?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0195_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} is choosin’.\nPlease wait.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0195_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0195_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} chose to retire.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0195_00016" index="16">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You cleared your SEVENTH Battle\nFactory match! Congratulations!\rFor your DEEP knowledge of homies,\nhere’s some BP!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0195_00017" index="17">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received {STRVAR_1 51, 1, 0} BP!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0195_00018" index="18">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Let’s swap back your homies.\nReturn the rentals with a full tank.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0195_00019" index="19">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Saving...\nDon’t turn off the power.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0195_00020" index="20">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0195_00021" index="21">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I did a lil research on your next opp.\nI’m basically a private investigator.\rExpect {STRVAR_1 0, 1, 0}, {STRVAR_1 0, 3, 0}, and\n{STRVAR_1 0, 5, 0}.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0195_00022" index="22">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’ve done a bit of research into your\nnext opponent.\rYou can expect to see {STRVAR_1 0, 1, 0}\nand {STRVAR_1 0, 3, 0}.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0195_00023" index="23">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’ve done a bit of research into your\nnext opponent.\rFirst out will be a tough,\n{STRVAR_1 6, 0, 0}-using {STRVAR_1 0, 1, 0}.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0195_00024" index="24">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’ve done a bit of research into your\nnext opponent.\rFirst out will be a Pokémon that has\nthe move {STRVAR_1 6, 0, 0}.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0195_00025" index="25">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’ve done a bit of research into your\nnext opponent.\rThe opponent seems to be good with\nthe {STRVAR_1 15, 0, 0} type.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0195_00026" index="26">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I did a lil research on your next opp.\rThey don’t care about types AT ALL.\nThey just vibin’. Scary.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0195_00027" index="27">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’ve done a bit of research into your\nnext opponent.\rYou can expect to see {STRVAR_1 0, 1, 0},\n{STRVAR_1 0, 2, 0}, {STRVAR_1 0, 3, 0}, and\f{STRVAR_1 0, 4, 0}.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0195_00028" index="28">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’ve done a bit of research into your\nnext opponent.\rYou can expect to see {STRVAR_1 0, 1, 0}\nand {STRVAR_1 0, 2, 0} first.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0195_00029" index="29">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’ve done a bit of research into your\nnext opponent.\rFirst out will be Pokémon with the moves\n{STRVAR_1 6, 0, 0} and {STRVAR_1 6, 1, 0}.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0195_00030" index="30">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’ve done a bit of research into your\nnext opponent.\rFirst out will be a Pokémon that has\nthe move {STRVAR_1 6, 0, 0}.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0195_00031" index="31">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">CONTINUE</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0195_00032" index="32">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">RECORD</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0195_00033" index="33">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">REST</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0195_00034" index="34">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">RETIRE</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0195_00035" index="35">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Congratulations, Hustler!\rFor your outstandin’ win streak, our\nFrontier Brain DEMANDS a match.\rYour next match is the Factory Head,\nand you CAN’T say no.\rYou prepared?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0195_00036" index="36">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Thorton: BZWEEEEEP!\rSorry, don’t mind me.\rThis my invention. A data-interpretin’\nmachine. I built it in my mom’s garage.\rIt tell me what you rented.\rI see! {STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0}, {STRVAR_1 0, 1, 0}, and {STRVAR_1 0, 2, 0}.\rThat’s a good setup. Like... {STRVAR_1 51, 3, 0}\npercent?\fDon’t worry about the number. The\nmachine\fmake ’em up sometimes.\rAll righty, let’s GO!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0195_00037" index="37">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Thorton: BZWEEEEEP!\rLemme scan you with my data machine.\nHold still. It’s bufferin’.\rWhat you rent this time...?\rI see! {STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0}, {STRVAR_1 0, 1, 0},\nand {STRVAR_1 0, 2, 0}.\rGood setup. Friendship AND teamwork.\nThe machine like it.\rLike... {STRVAR_1 51, 3, 0} percent?\fDon’t worry about the number.\rAll righty! No losin’ this time!\nThe machine PROMISED!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0195_00038" index="38">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Thorton: Hmm...\nI took the L.\rI’m NOT happy. At all. My machine lied.\nBut I got useful data, I guess.\rDid you like the homies you rented?\rAs Factory Head, it’d make me happy.\nCome back with different rentals.\fI’ll update the software.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0195_00039" index="39">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Thorton: Hmm... ANOTHER L.\rI’m NOT happy. I’m stewin’. I’m gon’\ngo yell at my machine.\rBut whatever. Some things you learn\nfrom winnin’. Some from losin’.\rI’ve learned a LOT from losin’. Too\nmuch.\rKeep rentin’ our homies so I can redeem\nmyself! Please! My mom watchin’!\r</language>
	</row>
</body>
